  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country program Malawi- Connect, Defend, Act! Joining Forces to Expand Civic Space</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support Civil Society Actors in Malawi in their efforts to defend and expand civic space.

The project aims to strategically support relevant actors within civil society whose work actively contributes to 
civic space from the perspective of different sectors and interests, while particularly including groups who are 
marginalized within civil society, such as women, youth, LGBTIQ+ persons and others.</narrative>
  </description>
